      <title>Alaska's Senate race faces claims of spoiler candidate. And, Hegseth ousts Army general</title>
      <author>Brittney Melton</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/10/30/g-s1-150889/up-first-newsletter-midterm-elections-iran-war-veteran-affairs-loans</link>
