h: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5532x3112+0+340/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fc3%2Fe7%2F609415ec43e281d8792878c56504%2Fimage.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5532x3112+0+340/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fc3%2Fe7%2F609415ec43e281d8792878c56504%2Fimage.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5532x3112+0+340/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fc3%2Fe7%2F609415ec43e281d8792878c56504%2Fimage.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5532x3112+0+340/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fc3%2Fe7%2F609415ec43e281d8792878c56504%2Fimage.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5532x3112+0+340/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fc3%2Fe7%2F609415ec43e281d8792878c56504%2Fimage.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5532x3112+0+340/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fc3%2Fe7%2F609415ec43e281d8792878c56504%2Fimage.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5532x3112+0+340/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fc3%2Fe7%2F609415ec43e281d8792878c56504%2Fimage.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5532x3112+0+340/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fc3%2Fe7%2F609415ec43e281d8792878c56504%2Fimage.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5532x3112+0+340/resize/1100/quality/50/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fc3%2Fe7%2F609415ec43e281d8792878c56504%2Fimage.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5532x3112+0+340/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fc3%2Fe7%2F609415ec43e281d8792878c56504%2Fimage.jpg" class="img" alt="COLMA, CALIFORNIA - JANUARY 06: Ford pickup trucks are displayed on the sales lot at Serramonte Ford on January 06, 2026 in Colma, California." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 COLMA, CALIFORNIA - JANUARY 06:  Ford pickup trucks are displayed on the sales lot at Serramonte Ford on January 06, 2026 in Colma, California.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Justin Sullivan/Getty Images/Getty Images North America                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;ol class="edTag"&gt;&lt;li&gt;American automakers reported &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/10/29/nx-s1-6008066/automakers-inflation-tariffs-chips-diesel-earnings" target="_blank"&gt;increased revenues for the third quarter&lt;/a&gt; but face serious challenges. They are paying more for key components like computer chips, steel and copper, as well as higher transport fuel costs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A hacking group &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/10/28/nx-s1-6021497/dhs-hack-ice" target="_blank"&gt;breached the U.S. Department of Homeland Security&lt;/a&gt;'s personnel files yesterday, exposing the names, phone numbers and addresses of over 40,000 DHS agents and associates, including those in undercover operations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Department of Health and Human Services announced a new policy that will let small compounding pharmacies &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/10/28/nx-s1-6021030/peptides-compounding-enforcement" target="_blank"&gt;make six peptides&lt;/a&gt; that haven't been approved by the Food and Drug Administration.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This newsletter was edited by &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/people/859721331/suzanne-nuyen"target="_blank"   &gt;&lt;em&gt;Suzanne Nuyen&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
