      <description>&lt;div id="storytext" class="storytext storylocation linkLocation"&gt;       &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Good morning. You're reading the Up First newsletter. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/newsletter/news" target="_blank"&gt;Subscribe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; here to get it delivered to your inbox, and &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/podcasts/510318/up-first/" target="_blank"&gt;listen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; to the Up First podcast for all the news you need to start your day.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;Today's top stories&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-149905-1" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 5135;         --source-height: 2888;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5135x2888+0+267/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F06%2F6a%2F46ec36764e5db11da70604db9122%2Fgettyimages-2301229190.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5135x2888+0+267/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F06%2F6a%2F46ec36764e5db11da70604db9122%2Fgettyimages-2301229190.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5135x2888+0+267/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F06%2F6a%2F46ec36764e5db11da70604db9122%2Fgettyimages-2301229190.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5135x2888+0+267/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F06%2F6a%2F46ec36764e5db11da70604db9122%2Fgettyimages-2301229190.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5135x2888+0+267/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F06%2F6a%2F